    "body": "## Summary\n- make blocked-user and expense policies mandatory dependencies of `JobService` so alternate wiring cannot silently disable them\n- cover blocked proposal submission, funding preflight, and acceptance before any commercial or notification side effects\n- codify the symmetric blocked-user behavior across discovery, new interactions, public data, history, and active-job lifecycle\n- update Tomcat from 11.0.24 to 11.0.25 after the container gate detected three newly fixable critical advisories\n- update the 965-point roadmap after completing the blocked-user and public-profile privacy audits\n\n## Validation\n- exact remote head: `741bcab700cce7ffc45d16b83ba6ff3408aa0ead`\n- remote tree matches local tree `1439bb45403d174b258a0b803ccceba32bfb5e72`\n- branch is exactly two commits ahead of `master` and zero commits behind\n- `git diff --check`\n- roadmap invariant: exactly 965 unique entries (`619 ✅ / 2 🟢 / 79 🟡 / 265 🔴`)\n- no nullable `UserBlockService`/`JobExpenseService` policy guards remain\n- local Maven execution unavailable in this runner; GitHub Actions is the authoritative test gate",
